@startuml F5.2-D04-atribuir-deliberador
title F5.2-D04 — Atribuir deliberador em massa
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Atribuir N selecionadas
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /requests/bulk
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE no escopo\n+ request_event cada
note right of Ctrl
  sem outbox ao aluno
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: coluna Deliberador

@enduml
